Error [E0108]: `n` holds Int (a whole number), but this value is Float (an approximate binary number)
  --> tests/ui/int_div_compound_on_int.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     n /= 2
    |     ^
 Why: a binding keeps one type for its whole life
 Fix: use `/%` to divide and round down (`/%=` in place), or make the binding a Float
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108
